#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:107
msgid ""
"The following task types require the Advanced or Enterprise tier: "
"Ansible, Chef, Puppet, Groovy Script, Python Script (Jython), and "
"vRealize Orchestrator. Bash and PowerShell tasks are available in all "
"tiers."
msgstr "Os seguintes tipos de tarefa requerem o nível Advanced ou Enterprise: Ansible, Chef, Puppet, Groovy Script, Python Script (Jython) e vRealize Orchestrator. Tarefas Bash e PowerShell estão disponíveis em todos os níveis."

