"Allows the user to set JavaScript logic. If it resolves to ``true``, "
"|morpheus| will run the Operational Workflow set as the \"IF OPERATIONAL "
"WORKFLOW\" and if it resolves to ``false``, |morpheus| will run the "
"\"ELSE OPERATIONAL WORKFLOW\""
msgstr "Permite ao usuário definir lógica JavaScript. Se resolver para ``true``, o |morpheus| executará o Workflow Operacional definido como \"IF OPERATIONAL WORKFLOW\" e se resolver para ``false``, o |morpheus| executará o \"ELSE OPERATIONAL WORKFLOW\""

#: ../../library/automation/tasks.rst:143
msgid ""
"N/A (JavaScript logic must be locally sourced, Tasks housed within the "
"associated Workflows may have different sourcing options depending on "
"their types.)"
msgstr "N/D (a lógica JavaScript deve ser de origem local; as Tarefas alojadas nos Workflows associados podem ter diferentes opções de origem dependendo de seus tipos.)"

